>no </span><span begin="00:28.562" end="00:29.740">ascending</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.522" end="00:35.881"><span begin="00:30.522" end="00:35.881">Rise</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.049" end="00:38.736"><span begin="00:36.049" end="00:36.251">Oh </span><span begin="00:36.251" end="00:36.409">back </span><span begin="00:36.409" end="00:36.600">when </span><span begin="00:36.600" end="00:37.425">I </span><span begin="00:37.425" end="00:37.865">was </span><span begin="00:37.865" end="00:38.736">younger</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.952" end="00:41.770"><span begin="00:38.952" end="00:39.145">Was </span><span begin="00:39.145" end="00:39.313">told </span><span begin="00:39.313" end="00:39.537">by </span><span begin="00:39.537" end="00:40.792">other </span><span begin="00:40.792" end="00:41.770">youngsters</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.925" end="00:47.837"><span begin="00:41.925" end="00:42.157">That </span><span begin="00:42.157" end="00:42.333">my </span><span begin="00:42.333" end="00:42.558">end </span><span begin="00:42.558" end="00:43.478">will </span><span begin="00:43.478" end="00:43.821">be </span><span begin="00:43.821" end="00:45.061">torture </span><span begin="00:45.061" end="00:45.382">beneath </span><span begin="00:45.382" end="00:45.613">the </span><span begin="00:45.613" end="00:47.837">earth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.005" end="00:50.718"><span begin="00:48.005" end="00:48.190">'Cause </span><span begin="00:48.190" end="00:48.391">I </span><span begin="00:48.391" end="00:48.613">don't </span><span begin="00:48.613" end="00:49.478">see </span><span begin="00:49.478" end="00:49.854">what </span><span begin="00:49.854" end="00:50.206">they </span><span begin="00:50.206" end="00:50.718">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.942" end="00:53.750"><span begin="00:50.942" end="00:51.158">When </span><span begin="00:51.158" end="00:51.342">death </span><span begin="00:51.342" end="00:51.565">i