="01:38.965" end="01:39.189">Sure </span><span begin="01:39.189" end="01:39.382">it's </span><span begin="01:39.382" end="01:39.598">a </span><span begin="01:39.598" end="01:40.517">calming </span><span begin="01:40.517" end="01:41.774">notion </span><span begin="01:42.030" end="01:42.373">perpetual </span><span begin="01:42.373" end="01:43.477">in </span><span begin="01:43.477" end="01:44.726">motion</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.966" end="01:52.277"><span begin="01:44.966" end="01:45.246">But </span><span begin="01:45.246" end="01:45.509">it's </span><span begin="01:45.509" end="01:46.262">not </span><span begin="01:46.262" end="01:46.957">what </span><span begin="01:46.957" end="01:47.710">you </span><span begin="01:47.710" end="01:48.470">signed </span><span begin="01:48.470" end="01:49.909">up </span><span begin="01:49.909" end="01:52.277">for</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.199" end="02:09.679"><span begin="02:04.199" end="02:04.473">I'm </span><span begin="02:04.473" end="02:04.833">sure </span><span begin="02:04.833" end="02:05.177">there </span><span begin="02:05.177" end="02:05.608">won't </span><span begin="02:05.608" end="02:06.351">always </span><span begin="02:06.351" end="02:06.713">be </span><span begin="02:06.713" end="02:09.679">sunshine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.065" end="02:15.489"><span begin="02:10.065" end="02:10.441">But </span><span begin="02:10.441" end="02:10.841">there's </span><span begin="02:10.841" end="02:11.249">this </span><span begin="02:11.249" end="02:12.784">momentary </span><span begin="02:12.784" end="02:13.968">beam </span><span begin="02:13.968" end="02:14.329">of </span><span begin="02:14.329" end="02:15.489">light</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.040" end="02:18.514"><span begin="02:16.040" end="02:16.257">You </span><span begin="02:16.257" end="02:16.481">don't </span><span begin="02:16.481" end="02:16.706">have </span><span begin="02:16.706" end="02:17.008">to </span><span begin="02:17.008" end="02:17.257">wait </span><span begin="02:17.257" end="02:17.553">those </span><span begin="02:17.553" end="02:17.833">salty </span><span begin="02:17.833" end="02:18.514">decades</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.793" end="02:21.448"><span begin="02:18.793" end="02:19.017">To </span><span begin="02:19.017" end="02:19.248">get </span><span begin="02:19.248" end="02:19.465">through </span><span begin="02:19.465" end="02:19.681">the </span><span begin="02:19.681" end="02:19.969">gate </span><span begin="02:19.969" end="02:20.200">it's </span><span begin="02:20.200" end="02:20.417">all </span><span begin="02:20.417" end="02:20.625">in </span><span begin="02:20.625" end="02:20.825">front </span><span begin="02:20.825" end="02:21.025">of </span><span begin="02:21.025" end="02:21.193">your </span><span begin="02:21.193" end="02:21.448">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.153" end="02:27.609"><span begin="02:22.153" end="02:22.553">I'm </span><span begin="02:22.553" end="02:22.849">sure </span><span begin="02:22.849" end="02:23.249">there </span><span begin="02:23.249" end="02:23.985">won't </span><span begin="02:23.985" end="02:24.464">always </span><span begin="02:24.464" end="02:24.873">be </span><span begin="02:24.873" end="02:27.609">sunshine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.513" end="02:33.969"><span begin="02:28.513" end="02:28.768">I'm </span><span begin="02:28.768" end="02:29.121">sure </span><span begin="02:29.121" end="02:29.458">there </span><span begin="02:29.458" end="02:29.856">won't </span><span begin="02:29.856" end="02:30.569">always </span><span begin="02:30.569" end="02:30.953">be </span><span begin="02:30.953" end="02:33.969">sunshine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.393" end="02:39.592"><span begin="02:34.393" end="02:34.761">But </span><span begin="02:34.761" end="02:35.144">there's </span><span begin="02:35.144" end="02:35.530">this </span><span begin="02:35.530" end="02:37.065">momentary </span><span 