><span begin="02:59.161" end="03:00.193">notion </span><span begin="03:00.193" end="03:00.593">but </span><span begin="03:00.593" end="03:00.841">it's </span><span begin="03:00.841" end="03:01.137">a </span><span begin="03:01.137" end="03:05.720">lie</span></p></div></body></tt>